# The API function answers /api/*; everything else is the single-page client. A workshop's
# addresses get the workshop's own copy of the page, which links its manifest, so an app installed
# from them starts in the workshop (ADR 0016): one line per folder under workshops/, before the
# catch-all. A file that exists at the address (the manifest, the reminder) is served as itself.
/api/*                  /.netlify/functions/api        200
/rural-manufacturing/*  /rural-manufacturing/index.html  200
/*                      /index.html                    200
